######## 23:43:27 mh-2: XE3= 拠点 3(Gi2)を EVPN-VPWS(EVI 150・端 3)に入れる
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE3(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet2
XE3(config-if)#
service instance 150 ethernet
XE3(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 150
XE3(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE3(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE3(config-if)#
exit
XE3(config)#
l2vpn evpn instance 150 point-to-point
XE3(config-evpn-evi)#
vpws context SITE3-SITE4
XE3(config-evpn-vpws)#
service target 4 source 3
XE3(config-evpn-vpws)#
member GigabitEthernet2 service-instance 150
XE3(config-evpn-vpws)#
end
XE3#
show running-config | section instance 150
